"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(22,7,10)\">Song 7:10</ref> = <highlight>the best wine</highlight> (read <bdbheb>כַּיַּיִן</bdbheb> ?) <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:133»§ 133</sup>. 3, R. 1; <bdbheb>יֵין מַלְכוּת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 1:7\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(17,1,7)\">Esth 1:7</ref> <highlight>royal wine</highlight>; <bdbheb>אֹצרְוֺת יַּיִן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 27:27\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(13,27,27)\">1Chr 27:27</ref> <highlight>stores of wine, wine-supply</highlight>; <bdbheb>יַיִן הָרֶקַח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 8:2\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(22,8,2)\">Song 8:2</ref> <highlight>spiced wine</highlight>; <bdbheb>מִשְׁתֵּה הַיַּיִן</bdbheb> <highlight>wine-feast</highlight> <ref ref=\"Esth 5:6\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(17,5,6)\">Esth 5:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 7:2\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(17,7,2)\">Esth 7:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 7:7\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(17,7,7)\">Esth 7:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 7:8\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(17,7,8)\">Esth 7:8</ref> <bdbheb>סֹבְאֵי יַיִן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 23:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,23,20)\">Prov 23:20</ref> <highlight>wine-bibbers</highlight>; <bdbheb>נאֹד יין</bdbheb> <highlight>wine-skin</highlight> <ref ref=\"Josh 9:4\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(6,9,4)\">Josh 9:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 9:13\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(6,9,13)\">Josh 9:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 16:20\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(9,16,20)\">1Sam 16:20</ref> <bdbheb>נֵבֶל יין</bdbheb> <highlight>id.</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:24\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,24)\">1Sam 1:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:3\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,3)\">1Sam 10:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 25:18\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(9,25,18)\">1Sam 25:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 16:1\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(10,16,1)\">2Sam 16:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 13:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,12)\">Jer 13:12</ref> (twice in verse); <bdbheb>בֵּית הַיָּ֑יִן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 2:4\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(22,2,4)\">Song 2:4</ref> either <highlight>wine-house</highlight>, where wine is drunk, feasting-house (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> and others), or <highlight>place of wine</highlight> = vineyard (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> and others; compare <bdbheb>גֶּפֶן יַיִן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 6:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,6,4)\">Num 6:4</ref>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> metaphor of wisdom's drink <ref ref=\"Prov 9:2\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(20,9,2)\">Prov 9:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 9:5\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(20,9,5)\">Prov 9:5</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Isa 55:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"55\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"55\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,55,1)\">Isa 55:1</ref> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s wrath <ref ref=\"Jer 25:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,25,15)\">Jer 25:15</ref> (<bdbheb>כּוֺס היין</bdbheb>); of confusion sent by <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>יַיִן תַּרְעֵלָה</bdbheb> <highlight>wine of reeling</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 60:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,60,5)\">Ps 60:5</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Ps 75:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"75\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"75\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,75,9)\">Ps 75:9</ref> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s awaking for vengeance, like a wine-shouter <ref ref=\"Ps 78:65\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"65\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"65\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,65)\">Ps 78:65</ref> of Babylon's fierce power <ref ref=\"Jer 51:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,7)\">Jer 51:7</ref> of love <ref ref=\"Song 5:1\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(22,5,1)\">Song 5:1</ref> <bdbheb>יֵין חֲמָסִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 4:17\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(20,4,17)\">Prov 4:17</ref> in simile of one bursting with words <ref ref=\"Job 32:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,32,19)\">Job 32:19</ref> of disheartened prophet <ref ref=\"Jer 23:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,9)\">Jer 23:9</ref> (<bdbheb>כְּגֶבֶר עֲבָרוֺיַיִן</bdbheb>); of lover's mouth <ref ref=\"Song 7:10\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(22,7,10)\">Song 7:10</ref> (see above); love is better than wine <ref ref=\"Song 1:2\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(22,1,2)\">Song 1:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 4:10\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(22,4,10)\">Song 4:10</ref>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Ps 75:9", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 75, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Gen 9:21", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 9, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Gen 14:18", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 14, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Ps 60:5", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 60, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Song 8:2", "book": "SNG", "chapter": 8, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Deut 32:18", "book": "DEU", "c